msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x02a618/0x000000
msgid "Take him out."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x02a619/0x000000
msgid "Look out! "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x02a61a/0x000000
msgid "It's one of the unmanneds! "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x02a61b/0x000000
msgid "Heads up!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x0f0cca/0x000000
msgid "Ah, Snake!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x0f0ccb/0x000000
msgid ""
"Snake, the pod's outfitted \n"
"with a self-defense module."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x0f0ccc/0x000000
msgid "Upon detecting attack,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x0f0ccc/0x000001
msgid ""
"it aborts its command and enters \n"
"small-target suppression mode."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x0f0ccd/0x000000
msgid ""
"Right now, Peace Walker's highest \n"
"priority target is you."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x14830e/0x000000
msgid "\"Soldiers Without Borders\""
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x168cbf/0x000000
msgid "...3, 2, 1, launch."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x16da59/0x000000
msgid "Damn"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x16da5c/0x000000
msgid "It won't open."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x223c99/0x000000
msgid "Looks like there's no way around 'em. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x223c99/0x000001
msgid "You up for this, Snake?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x3c293d/0x000000
msgid "Snake, it's getting away!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x47cb34/0x000000
msgid "I gotta thank you for agreeing to this, Snake."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x47cb34/0x000001
msgid "Man... am I glad to be out here."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x47cb34/0x000002
msgid ""
"Finally, we can leave all that crap \n"
"in San Hieronymo behind... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x47cb34/0x000003
msgid "And break into the mercenary business for real."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x47cb34/0x000004
msgid "Let me guess. You're doing it for her, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x584449/0x000000
msgid ""
"It's calculating ballistic trajectory... \n"
"once that's finished, it's all over."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x5fe93d/0x000000
msgid "Snake, you've got to destroy the platform!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x74d559/0x000000
msgid "Check out the cargo!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x74d55a/0x000000
msgid "The nukes!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x8e81a0/0x000000
msgid "There they are... CIA mercs. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x8e81a0/0x000001
msgid "Snake, you've got to get past them undetected."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x8e81a0/0x000002
msgid "Avoid combat whenever possible."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x94ec7d/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, I found Zadornov. I had to kill him."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x94ec7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"Something's not right here. \n"
"I'm thinking he had a friend."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x94ec7f/0x000000
#: slot/0x00dff09b/0xaf8d11/0x000020
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c7f/0x000000
msgid "Paz...?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c80/0x000000
msgid "Get down from there before you hurt somebody."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c81/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, shut that thing down..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c82/0x000000
msgid "Then how's it moving?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c83/0x000000
msgid "Modifications?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c83/0x000001
msgid "Paz, what are you... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c84/0x000000
msgid "Paz,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c84/0x000001
msgid "what are you doing...?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c85/0x000000
msgid "Cipher...?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c86/0x000000
msgid "Paz! Get down from there!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c9d/0x000000
msgid "Paz, you can't..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x952c9e/0x000000
msgid "The... real project?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eea/0x000000
msgid "\"Zero.\""
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eec/0x000000
msgid "...Sure."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eed/0x000000
msgid "Kaz..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eee/0x000000
msgid "I suppose you were the one"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eee/0x000001
msgid ""
"who brought them to Colombia \n"
"in the first place, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8eef/0x000000
msgid "You knew all of this...?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8ef0/0x000000
msgid "Was that your goal all along?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8ef1/0x000000
msgid "Kaz, it's... not going to be that easy."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8ef2/0x000000
msgid "This whole Peace Walker thing has left our mark"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8ef2/0x000001
msgid "on the history of the old order."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f09/0x000000
msgid ""
"We've put ourselves on the radar \n"
"of intelligence agencies"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f09/0x000001
msgid "and governments East and West."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f09/0x000002
msgid "The whole world probably knows about us now."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0a/0x000000
msgid "We've let ourselves interfere with the times "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0a/0x000001
msgid "- with the Cold War system of deterrence."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0b/0x000000
msgid "We're an army without a flag."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0b/0x000001
msgid ""
"We weren't supposed to take sides in \n"
"international affairs."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0b/0x000002
msgid "But we did."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0c/0x000000
msgid "We'll be hunted."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0d/0x000000
msgid "You're damn right. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0d/0x000001
msgid "We upset the global military balance of power."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0e/0x000000
msgid "They're gonna come knocking real soon. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0e/0x000001
msgid "There's no turning back now."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f0f/0x000000
msgid "We're a wrench in the old system of deterrence."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f10/0x000000
msgid "As long as the times refuse to change,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f10/0x000001
msgid "we're going to make a hell of a racket."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f11/0x000000
msgid "The establishment... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f11/0x000001
msgid "anybody who tries to restore the old balance,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f11/0x000002
msgid "wants to snuff us out of existence."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f12/0x000000
msgid ""
"It won't be a particular country \n"
"or ideology that hunts us."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f29/0x000000
msgid ""
"We're gonna be fighting \n"
"the biggest beast of all - the times."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2a/0x000000
msgid ""
"Ten years ago, the times rejected The Boss... \n"
"and killed her."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2b/0x000000
msgid "And now we're the ones being tested."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2c/0x000000
msgid "Will the times erase us?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2c/0x000001
msgid "Or work with us?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2d/0x000000
msgid ""
"It's gonna be a lonely battle... \n"
"No good or evil, no winners or losers."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2e/0x000000
msgid "Business will have to wait."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2e/0x000001
msgid "The question we have to ask ourselves now is,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2e/0x000002
msgid ""
"can we survive long enough \n"
"to see the 21st century?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f2f/0x000000
msgid "The hunt is on, Kaz, "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f30/0x000000
msgid "and the whole world's on our tail."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9d8f30/0x000001
msgid "Assemble the men!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9f6190/0x000000
msgid "Boss!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0x9f6194/0x000000
msgid "Hey, Boss, wanna go a round?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa0c0d8/0x000000
msgid "Big Boss!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa0c0da/0x000000
msgid "My work is done..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa0c0db/0x000000
msgid "\"V for Victory\""
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa0c0db/0x000001
msgid "Rocket Peace!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000000
msgid "The year was 1964. The world was firmly in the grip of the Cold War, divided into East and West."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000001
msgid "One of America's heroes had defected to the Soviet Union."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000002
msgid "She was known as \"The Boss,\" the mother of the special forces, and the soldier said to have led the Allies to victory in World War II."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000003
msgid "However, the American-made miniature nuclear warhead she took with her was used to destroy a Soviet research facility."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000004
msgid "Facing full-scale nuclear war, the leaders of the world's superpowers held top-secret talks to avert Armageddon."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000005
msgid "The Soviet Union wanted assurance that this was not the work of Uncle Sam. They wanted America to eliminate one of its most legendary soldiers, The Boss."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000006
msgid "The person assigned this mission was her closest apprentice, the soldier known as \"Snake.\""
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000007
msgid "Snake made the anguished journey into enemy territory, eventually confronting and killing The Boss at a fortress called Groznjy Grad, proving America's innocence and avoiding nuclear holocaust."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000008
msgid "Having saved the world, Snake was hailed a true hero and given the title \"Big Boss.\""
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa11cdb/0x000009
msgid "Following the award ceremony, however, Snake disappeared."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa1a625/0x000000
msgid "Huh... So much for our fugitive..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa1a626/0x000000
msgid "...Someone inside MSF... huh?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa1a627/0x000000
msgid "...It's ZEKE... It's moving!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa1a628/0x000000
msgid "There's somebody inside, I can see them..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa1a629/0x000000
msgid "Snake, get up here pronto!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa9a6a5/0x000000
msgid "What's going on? She's not herself... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa9a6a6/0x000000
msgid "I can't, the controls aren't responding."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa9a6a7/0x000000
msgid "Then... Zadornov's escape... was a diversion!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xa9a6a8/0x000000
msgid "Taking it back? Where?!"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f426/0x000000
msgid "That name Paz mentioned at the end"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f426/0x000001
msgid "- \"Cipher\" - it's a code."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f426/0x000002
msgid "It means \"empty\"... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f427/0x000000
msgid "It also means..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f428/0x000000
msgid "A world of electronic intelligence built on codes."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f428/0x000001
msgid "And at the center of it all, a zero..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f429/0x000000
msgid "Uh, look, Boss... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f429/0x000001
msgid "I owe you an apology."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42a/0x000000
msgid "Hear me out, OK?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42b/0x000000
msgid "I, uh, I knew Paz and the professor... "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42b/0x000001
msgid "I knew who they really were, all along."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42c/0x000000
msgid "I used them."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42d/0x000000
msgid "Guilty as charged."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42d/0x000001
msgid "Paz wasn't just CIA, you know. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42d/0x000002
msgid "She was working for the KGB, too."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42e/0x000000
msgid "And for this Cipher group."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f42e/0x000001
msgid "In other words, she was a triple agent."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f445/0x000000
msgid "Wait, let me finish."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f446/0x000000
msgid "Listen,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f446/0x000001
msgid ""
"MSF never would have gotten this big \n"
"if it weren't for them."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f447/0x000000
msgid "This mercenary business we've built"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f447/0x000001
msgid ""
"someday, it's going to be a new driving force \n"
"in the world economy."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f448/0x000000
msgid "...The Cold War's not going to last forever. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f448/0x000001
msgid "Sooner or later, it's going to give way to "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f448/0x000002
msgid "an era of regional conflicts and terrorism."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f449/0x000000
msgid ""
"A paradigm shift from counter-Communism \n"
"to counter-terrorism."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44a/0x000000
msgid "In the new age, armies won't be tied to states,"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44a/0x000001
msgid "and war will become a business."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44b/0x000000
msgid "We'll be a valuable commodity. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44b/0x000001
msgid ""
"There'll be clients all over the world \n"
"who need our services."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44c/0x000000
msgid "MSF is only the beginning. "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44c/0x000001
msgid "What we're creating here is a revolution in itself. Am I right?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f44e/0x000000
msgid "Including that Cipher outfit..."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f465/0x000000
msgid "I see your point."
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f465/0x000001
msgid "So what happens to us now?"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xb5f466/0x000000
msgid "Not everybody's gonna be happy with us, huh?"
